# stackguardian_workflow_step_template_revision (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Revisions

Each revision is a version of its parent
[`stackguardian_workflow_step_template`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/workflow_step_template), referenced by `template_id`.
Publish it with `is_public` before referencing it from a workflow's `wf_steps_config`.

